cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CDFI Framework: Evaluation Governance Infrastructure for Domain-Specific AI Doctrinal Benchmarking"
abstract: >
  A reusable evaluation governance methodology for building domain-specific AI doctrinal
  benchmarks. Derived from seven frontier AI safety research publications and translated
  into a scoring architecture for Catholic doctrinal evaluation. Includes the Catholic
  Doctrinal Fidelity Index (CDFI) formula, weighting matrix, pass/fail cap gates,
  deployment tiers, and a four-part judge reliability certification protocol.
  SAICRED v2 is the reference implementation.
